    - Name: text
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Feather Land is still in active development, so you may encounter bugs,
        missing features, or balance issues. Your feedback means a lot\u2014it helps
        make the game better and cozier. By joining this playtest, you\u2019re helping
        shape how the forest grows. We may also use anonymous gameplay data to improve
        the game. Thank you for being part of the journey! "
