    - Name: text
      Entry: 1
      Data: The kiwi is a small, flightless bird native to New Zealand. It has a
        long beak with nostrils at the tip, shaggy feathers, and strong legs. Nocturnal
        and shy, it uses its excellent sense of smell to find food.
